  "abstract": {
    "value": "A plausible mechanism is shown in Scheme 1, although it is highly speculative. Hydropalladation of 1a with the hydridopalladium species generated from Pd<sup>0</sup> and benzoic acid would produce the vinylpalladium intermediate 4, which would undergo $\\beta \\mathrm { \\cdot }$ -elimination to give allene 5 coordinated with the hydridopalladium. Subsequent hydropalladation of 5 would furnish the π-allylpalladium species 6. Nucleophilic attack of the amine on the π-allyl moiety would give the product 2a along with the hydridopalladium catalyst.",
